@startuml 07_deployment
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK TC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
title 投稿審查系統 - 部署圖 (Deployment Diagram)
node "使用者電腦" {
  node "瀏覽器" {
    artifact "index.html\napp.js / api.js\nstyle.css" as FE
  }
  node "Node.js" {
    component "Express 伺服器\n(server.js, port 3000)" as API
    component "ManuscriptService\nAuthService" as SVC
  }
  database "MySQL\n(port 3306)\nmanuscript_review" as DB
}
FE --> API : HTTP / JSON\n(REST API)
API --> SVC
SVC --> DB : SQL (mysql2)
@enduml
